# Deadwind Pass - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The data holds no rare-flagged spawns in Deadwind Pass - all 34 NPCs on the
# key were scanned and none carries the rare flag - so this guide is treasures
# only, said plainly: three fixed unique objects, each a single confirmed
# point, no loops. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route
# or standalone. EVERY goal is optional. Spawn points are the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever). No tame lines ship (no rares, no beast-drop
# evidence, and the core quest kills nothing - see
# docs/deadwind-pass-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory, including
# why quest 9205 stays out). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none
# are stated. This guide never accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/deadwind-pass-rares
title Deadwind Pass - Rares & Treasures
levels 60-60
zone Deadwind Pass
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords deadwind pass, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Charred Bone Fragment - the crypts approach

  zone map 1430

  goto 45,78.96
  note A fixed bone fragment on the approach to the crypts. Contents are unconfirmed in the data; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Advanced Swordplay - the crypts approach

  zone map 1430

  goto 43,74.4
  note A fixed book on the approach to the crypts. Contents are unconfirmed in the data; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Raw Plated Armorfish recipe object - the Scenic overlook

  zone map 1430

  goto 52.4,34.5
  note A fixed recipe object above the northern road. The recipe itself is routed as a Cooking source in the Deadwind Pass recipes companion; nothing else here to collect. Respawn timer unconfirmed.
